  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legitimacy, accountability, victims&apos; participation and reparation in transitional justice settings - lessons from and for Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The research explores the main factors that are relevant for providing the justice component of a holistic approach to transitional justice, looking at current Colombian process, challenging it&#x2019;s legitimacy, benefitting social welfare. SDG:5,10,16</narrative>
  </description>
